    "english": {
      "headingRaw": "Folk-song-styled-verseLiBaiTHEMOONATTHEFORTIFIEDPASS",
      "translationRaw": "ThebrightmoonliftsfromtheMountainofHeavenInaninfinitehazeofcloudandsea，Andthewind，thathascomeathousandmiles，BeatsattheJadePassbattlements。。。。ChinamarchesitsmendownBaidengRoadWhileTartartroopspeeracrossbluewatersofthebay。。。。AndsincenotonebattlefamousinhistorySentallitsfightersbackagain，Thesoldiersturnround，lookingtowardtheborder，Andthinkofhome，withwistfuleyes，AndofthosetonightintheupperchambersWhotossandsighandcannotrest。",
